> Module Knockouts_household

> Using Types
> Using Filers as F
> Using Knockouts_income as KI

# Knockouts B: household, credit and PTC unsupported situations (issue #37)

Direct File refuses to compute a return in a situation it does not support
(`flow.xml` `/flowIsKnockedOut`, an `Any` over about 98 facts; the income, HSA
and process members are in `catala/knockouts_income.catala_en`, issue #36). This
module is the other half: the household (`filers.xml`, `familyAndHousehold.xml`,
`dependentsBenefitSplit.xml`), credit (`eitc.xml`, `ctcOdc.xml`, `cdcc.xml`,
`saversCredits.xml`) and Premium Tax Credit (`ptc.xml`) members. Each module
that is merged computes its own `ko_` conditions and a per-module `unsupported`
(CONVENTIONS section 6). This module

1. takes each of those conditions as an input (`in_...`): the Calculator
   passes the real outputs of the module scopes it already runs, so the
   conditions are computed once, in the module that owns the situation;
2. defines the one household knockout that no merged module owns,
   `/knockoutPersonBornAndDiedInTaxYearWithoutTin` (`familyAndHousehold.xml`
   lines 668 and 715): a member born and died in 2024 with no TIN;
3. exposes one output condition per knockout, named `ko_` plus the DF fact,
   the combined `unsupported_household` and the list `fired_knockouts` of
   `KI.KnockoutReason` constructors that fired (one constructor per DF fact).

Knockouts that are in the merged modules but that DF does not list in
`/flowIsKnockedOut` keep the `ExtraXxx` reason, as in `Knockouts_income`: the
return would be wrong otherwise.

## DF members of `/flowIsKnockedOut` that need no condition

- `/knockoutStudentOrDisabled` (`cdcc.xml` line 3957): DF refuses the return
  when a student or disabled filer or spouse reports a month with earnings
  below the deemed amount. IRC 21(d)(2) deems $250 (one qualifying person) or
  $500 (two or more) of monthly earnings for such a spouse, and
  `Cdcc.deemed_income_uplift` computes it (statute first, CONVENTIONS
  section 8), so the situation is supported and there is no knockout. The
  case the module cannot compute, deemed income for both spouses, is
  `ko_both_spouses_deemed_income`.

## Declarations

```catala-metadata
## One household member's vital data (`familyAndHousehold.xml`).
declaration structure MemberVitals:
  # DF: /familyAndHousehold/*/dateOfBirth
  data date_of_birth content date
  # DF: /familyAndHousehold/*/deceased
  data deceased content boolean
  # DF: /familyAndHousehold/*/hasTinTypeOfNone
  data has_tin_type_none content boolean

declaration scope KnockoutsHousehold:
  # DF: /familyAndHousehold, the data of the born-and-died test
  input member_vitals content list of MemberVitals
  # DF: filers.xml /flowKnockoutFilerAgeYoungerThan16; Filers.ko_flow_knockout_filer_age_younger_than16
  input in_flow_knockout_filer_age_younger_than16 condition
  # DF: filers.xml /spouseItemizesKnockout; Filers.ko_spouse_itemizes_knockout
  input in_spouse_itemizes_knockout condition
  # DF: filers.xml /primaryFilerResidencyKnockout; Filers.ko_primary_filer_residency_knockout
  input in_primary_filer_residency_knockout condition
  # DF: filers.xml /flowKnockoutHasApplicableRegisteredDomesticPartnership; Filers.ko_flow_knockout_has_applicable_registered_domestic_partnership
  input in_flow_knockout_has_applicable_registered_domestic_partnership condition
  # DF: filers.xml /knockoutSubjectToCommunityPropertyLaws; Filers.ko_knockout_subject_to_community_property_laws
  input in_knockout_subject_to_community_property_laws condition
  # DF: familyAndHousehold.xml /knockoutHohQpHasNoTin; Hoh_qss_persons.HohQssPersons.ko_knockout_hoh_qp_has_no_tin
  input in_knockout_hoh_qp_has_no_tin condition
  # DF: dependentsBenefitSplit.xml /knockedOutByNonCustodialParentBenefitSplit; Dependents_benefit_split ko_knocked_out_by_non_custodial_parent_benefit_split
  input in_knocked_out_by_non_custodial_parent_benefit_split condition
  # DF: dependentsBenefitSplit.xml /knockedOutByContradictory8832; Dependents_benefit_split ko_knocked_out_by_contradictory8832
  input in_knocked_out_by_contradictory8832 condition
  # DF: flow.xml /saversCreditKnockouts; Savers_credit.ko_savers_credit_knockouts
  input in_savers_credit_knockouts condition
  # DF: cdcc.xml /flowKnockoutBenefitsDistribution; Cdcc.Form2441.ko_flow_knockout_benefits_distribution
  input in_flow_knockout_benefits_distribution condition
  # DF: cdcc.xml /knockoutCdccWorksheetA; Cdcc.Form2441PartIII.ko_knockout_cdcc_worksheet_a
  input in_knockout_cdcc_worksheet_a condition
  # DF: cdcc.xml /flowKnockoutHouseholdEmployee; Cdcc.Form2441PartIII.ko_knockout_household_employee
  input in_flow_knockout_household_employee condition
  # DF: ptc.xml /dependentTpRequiresAllocations; Ptc_allowed.PtcAllowed.ko_dependent_tp_requires_allocations
  input in_dependent_tp_requires_allocations condition
  # DF: ptc.xml /hasPtcQualifyingPlanAndQsehra; Ptc_allowed ko_has_ptc_qualifying_plan_and_qsehra
  input in_has_ptc_qualifying_plan_and_qsehra condition
  # DF: ptc.xml /needsAllocations; Ptc_allowed ko_needs_allocations
  input in_needs_allocations condition
  # DF: ptc.xml /hasEmployerSponsoredPlan; Ptc_allowed ko_has_employer_sponsored_plan
  input in_has_employer_sponsored_plan condition
  # DF: ptc.xml /dependentsRequiredToFile; Ptc_allowed ko_dependents_required_to_file
  input in_dependents_required_to_file condition
  # DF: ptc.xml /selfReportedHasMultiple1095As; Ptc_allowed ko_self_reported_has_multiple1095_as
  input in_self_reported_has_multiple1095_as condition
  # DF: ptc.xml /hasImmigrationStatusNotEligibleForMarketplace; Ptc_allowed ko_has_immigration_status_not_eligible_for_marketplace
  input in_has_immigration_status_not_eligible_for_marketplace condition
  # DF: ptc.xml /wantsToUseAltCalculations; Ptc_allowed ko_wants_to_use_alt_calculations
  input in_wants_to_use_alt_calculations condition
  # No flow.xml fact: ; IRC 152(c)(4) tie-breaker cannot be decided from the return (DF-BUG-3); Qualifying_child.ko_qualifying_child_tie_breaker
  input in_qualifying_child_tie_breaker condition
  # No flow.xml fact: ; Eitc.ko_claimed_spouse_combat_pay_without_mfj
  input in_claimed_spouse_combat_pay_without_mfj condition
  # No flow.xml fact: ; Filing_status.ko_filing_status_not_eligible (DF refuses invalid status in its UI)
  input in_filing_status_not_eligible condition
  # No flow.xml fact: ; Cdcc.Form2441PartIII.ko_sole_proprietorship_benefits (Form 2441 line 22)
  input in_sole_proprietorship_benefits condition
  # No flow.xml fact: ; Cdcc.Form2441PartIII.ko_both_spouses_deemed_income (Reg. 1.21-2(b)(4)(iii))
  input in_both_spouses_deemed_income condition
  # No flow.xml fact: ; /tpNeedsToAdd1095A, BlockSubmissionOnTrue (ptc.xml line 1027); Ptc_allowed.ko_tp_needs_to_add1095_a
  input in_tp_needs_to_add1095_a condition
  # No flow.xml fact: ; /tpNeedsToDelete1095A, BlockSubmissionOnTrue (ptc.xml line 1042); Ptc_allowed.ko_tp_needs_to_delete1095_a
  input in_tp_needs_to_delete1095_a condition

  # DF: familyAndHousehold.xml /knockoutPersonBornAndDiedInTaxYearWithoutTin
  output ko_knockout_person_born_and_died_in_tax_year_without_tin condition
  output ko_flow_knockout_filer_age_younger_than16 condition
  output ko_spouse_itemizes_knockout condition
  output ko_primary_filer_residency_knockout condition
  output ko_flow_knockout_has_applicable_registered_domestic_partnership condition
  output ko_knockout_subject_to_community_property_laws condition
  output ko_knockout_hoh_qp_has_no_tin condition
  output ko_knocked_out_by_non_custodial_parent_benefit_split condition
  output ko_knocked_out_by_contradictory8832 condition
  output ko_savers_credit_knockouts condition
  output ko_flow_knockout_benefits_distribution condition
  output ko_knockout_cdcc_worksheet_a condition
  output ko_flow_knockout_household_employee condition
  output ko_dependent_tp_requires_allocations condition
  output ko_has_ptc_qualifying_plan_and_qsehra condition
  output ko_needs_allocations condition
  output ko_has_employer_sponsored_plan condition
  output ko_dependents_required_to_file condition
  output ko_self_reported_has_multiple1095_as condition
  output ko_has_immigration_status_not_eligible_for_marketplace condition
